    engine2d_embedded_wm_example_stale_chrome_oracles_2026-11-26, 0, "WM example in engine2d_embedded_surface_spec asserts a themed chrome stream (body alpha 0x33, hit rects) but the spec installs no WM theme so the historic plain stream (shadow first) is emitted; content fixture 120x52 vs product (w-8)x(h-36)=112x44 draws the invalid placeholder; shared Vulkan child alpha oracle 0x33330000 vs straight-alpha 0x33FF0000."

